---
import LegalPage from "../components/LegalPage.astro";
import { site } from "../lib/site";
---

<LegalPage
  title="Terms of Service"
  description={`The terms for using the ${site.businessName} website and requesting water softener estimates and services in ${site.city}, ${site.stateAbbr}.`}
  updated="October 12, 2026"
>
  <p>
    These Terms of Service govern your use of {site.domain}, operated by {site.businessName} ("we", "us").
    By using the website you agree to them. If you do not agree, please do not use the website.
  </p>

  <h2>What this website does</h2>
  <p>
    This website gives general information about water softeners, filtration and water testing in
    {site.city}, {site.stateAbbr} and nearby areas, and lets you request a free estimate. Information on the
    website is for general guidance only and is not engineering, plumbing, legal or health advice.
  </p>

  <h2>Estimates and services</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A free estimate is not a contract. A price is confirmed only in a written quote you accept.</li>
    <li>Work may be carried out by independent licensed professionals who serve your area. The terms, warranty and price for any work are set out in the written quote or invoice from the provider who performs it.</li>
    <li>Water test results show conditions at the time and place of the test and can change over time.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Accuracy of information</h2>
  <p>
    We work to keep the information on this website accurate, including local water data. Public water quality
    figures change; check your water utility's latest Consumer Confidence Report for current numbers.
    We do not guarantee that the website is complete, current or error free.
